  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Roughly chop capsicum and brown onion (see ingredients). </li>\n• <li>Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons.</li>\n• <li>Finely chop or crush garlic.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73564fff2efa4150deb75/step-f6e7c000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Heat a large frying pan over high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.</li>\n• <li>Cook capsicum, zucchini and onion until slightly softened, 5-7 mins.</li>\n• <li>Reduce heat to medium, then add tomato &amp; herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73564fff2efa4150deb75/step-2f10c610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Stir in diced tomatoes, the water, brown sugar and half the butter until combined, 2-3 mins. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</li>\n• <li>Using the back of your spoon, make small wells in the mixture and crack the eggs into each well.</li>\n• <li>Reduce heat to low, cover with a lid or foil and simmer until eggs are set, 4-6 mins (or until cooked to your liking).</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73564fff2efa4150deb75/step-3cb64320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>While the eggs are cooking, cut continental rolls into slices. Toast or grill rolls to your liking.</li>\n• <li>In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave garlic and the remaining butter in 10 second bursts, until melted and fragrant.</li>\n• <li>Spread garlic butter over toasted rolls. Season with salt and pepper.</li>\n• <li>Divide veggie-loaded shakshuka between bowls. </li>\n• <li>Crumble over fetta cubes. </li>\n• <li>Serve with garlic bread.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73564fff2efa4150deb75/step-de371e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
